<mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>has no more <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"38\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-intercepts.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Because the leading coefficient is positive, the graph takes an inverted <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"39\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-ss\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D5B2 TEX-SS\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext mathvariant=\"sans-serif\">S</mtext></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-shape. Therefore, the graph looks as follows:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-39032-a-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-39032-a-1\"></div></div></div>",
